"tnamev2": "单机主机类游戏", "pid_v2": 1008, "pid_name_v2": "游戏", "attribute_v3": 4, "current_state": 0, "global_state": 0, "bvid": "BV1e2ad6cEK4", "season_type": 0, "is_ogv": false, "ogv_info": null, "enable_vt": 0, "ai_rcmd": null, "rcmd_reason": {"content": "", "corner_mark": 0}}, {"aid": 117360635743073, "videos": 1, "tid": 17, "tname": "单机游戏", "copyright": 3, "pic": "http://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/7c2051ea4e890e846280fdb5b4ca999c1c99d592.jpg", "title": "28年前宣称可以审判玩家灵魂的电子游戏，究竟是怎么一回事？", "pubdate": 1790784298, "ctime": 1790784299, "desc": "起床补简介了\n\n路西法luciferd，一款1998年发售的日本游戏，制作方TEN研究所是做老虎机出生的\n游戏宣称，可以审判玩家的灵魂，每次通关一个章节后，都会给出性格测试\n该游戏有权威占卜师、心理学家等人背书，可谓是非常之神棍\n\n游戏的五个世界，我个人觉得都很有趣，你要做出抉择，自己的思考\n但事情的发展，似乎未能如愿\n哎，其实用现在的眼光看，以前的老游戏剧情还是挺短板的，这个游戏的故事，在当时其实已经很不错了，甚至说惊艳，但矛盾冲突什么的，在如今的作品面前还是不够有张力，我看有人说，感觉不如”我怕吃了烧", "state": 0, "duration": 4272, "rights": {"bp": 0, "elec": 0, "download": 0, "movie": 0, "pay": 0, "hd5": 0, "no_reprint": 0, "autoplay": 1, "ugc_pay": 0, "is_cooperation": 0, "ugc_pay_preview": 0, "no_background": 0, "arc_pay": 0, "pay_free_watch": 0}, "owner": {"mid": 246370149, "name": "33不是山山", "face": "https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/face/a80673d77fb95d70eb098b5880c4dd1d54ce7e2c.jpg"}, "stat": {"aid": 117360635743073, "view": 594982, "danmaku": 2001, "reply": 1062, "favorite": 23475, "coin": 21009, "share": 854, "now_rank": 0, "his_rank": 60, "like": 60510, "dislike": 0, "vt": 0, "vv": 594982, "fav_g": 0, "like_g": 39}, "dynamic": "", "cid": 42346220355, "dimension": {"width": 1920, "height": 1080, "rotate": 0}, "short_link_v2": "https://b23.tv/BV1z7af6mEWG", "first_frame": "http://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/storyff/_00003bxbu8pula87d2c6zleih0dwmtb_firsti.jpg", "pub_location": "江苏", "cover43": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/3263f4827061f6d6ffa7aeb6af990868c39e2f53.jpg", "tidv2": 2079, "tnamev2": "其他游戏", "pid_v2": 1008, "pid_name_v2": "游戏", "attribute_v3": 4, "current_state": 0, "global_state": 0, "bvid": "BV1z7af6mEWG", "season_type": 0, "is_ogv": false, "ogv_info": null, "enable_vt":